sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: QA Mode (Visual Query)

    actor Blind User
    participant Mic as Microphone
    participant Parser as Command Parser
    participant Mgr as Mode Manager
    participant AI as AI Engine
    participant TTS as Feedback Service

    %% Step 1: Blind User asks a question
    Blind User->>Mic: "What is in my hand?"
    Mic->>Parser: Audio Stream
    Parser-->>Mgr: Intent: QA_IDENTIFY_OBJECT

    %% Step 2: System takes control to see
    Mgr->>Mgr: Switch State -> QA_PROCESSING
    Mgr->>AI: Command: Capture & Analyze Frame

    activate AI
    AI->>AI: Process Image (YOLO + OCR)
    AI-->>Mgr: Return: "Medicine Bottle, 500mg"
    deactivate AI

    %% Step 3: System answers
    Mgr->>TTS: Speak("It is a Medicine Bottle, 500mg")
    TTS->>Blind User: "It is a Medicine Bottle, 500mg"
